### Performance Multi-Tenant
```php
public function fetchEvents(array $fetchInfo): array
{
    $cacheKey = sprintf(
        'calendar_events_%s_%s_%s_%s',
        auth()->id(),
        $this->getTenantId(),
        $fetchInfo['start'],
        $fetchInfo['end']
    );

    return cache()->remember($cacheKey, 300, function () use ($fetchInfo) {
        return $this->queryEvents($fetchInfo);
    });
}
